Meet the Feebles is a comedy, music, fantasy film directed by Peter Jackson.

3
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Heidi, star of the "Meet The Feebles Variety Hour" discovers
her lover Bletch the Walrus is cheating on her.

4
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:46,000
And with all the world waiting for the show, the assorted co-stars must contend with
drug addiction, extortion, robbery, disease, drug dealing, and murder.

